# Publish perf report (agent)

Whenever you run a **publish** script for c35 (or the user asks you to publish), you **must** end your reply with a **Publish summary** sourced from perf output — not guesses.

## Scripts

| Script | `target` (typical) |
|--------|-------------------|
| `.\_\scripts\deploy\publish_c35_rust_chef.ps1` | `c35-rust-chef` |
| `.\_\scripts\deploy\publish_server.ps1` | `c35-server` |
| `.\_\scripts\deploy\publish_fetcher.ps1` | `c35-fetcher` |
| `.\_\scripts\deploy\publish_node_stats.ps1` | `c35-node-stats` |
| `.\_\scripts\deploy\publish_channel_whatsapp_device.ps1` | `channel-whatsapp-device` |
| `.\_\scripts\deploy\publish_app_release.ps1` | see app targets below |

### App / client `target` values (Dart `C35_PUBLISH_PERF`)

| `target` | When |
|----------|------|
| `app-release` | Full `deploy_app_release.dart` (AAB+APK+optional win/web) |
| `android-promote-prod` | `-AndroidPromote` / `play_store_upload_promote_prod.dart` |
| `android-promote-only` | `-PromoteOnly N` |
| `android-tester` | `-Tester` |
| `android-release` | `-AndroidOnly` |
| `windows-release` | `-WindowsOnly` |
| `web-release` | `-WebOnly` |
| `remote-windows-agent` | `-RemoteAgent` |

## Metrics sources

1. Console: `C35 publish perf` block + `C35_PUBLISH_PERF {json}`.
2. File: `.cache/publish-perf/latest.json`.

### Cluster marks (PowerShell)

`context_tar`, `context_upload`, `context_extract`, `buildctl`, `image_build`, `rollout`, `wall_total`

### App marks (Dart `marks` in JSON)

| Mark | Meaning |
|------|---------|
| `android_aab` | `flutter build appbundle` |
| `android_apk` | `flutter build apk` |
| `flutter_web` | `flutter build web` |
| `flutter_windows` | `flutter build windows` |
| `windows_zip` | Zip bundle step |
| `load_play_store_credentials`, `upload_*`, … | `runStep` labels (slugged) |

### App artifacts (`artifacts_bytes`)

`android_aab`, `android_apk`, `web`, `windows_zip` — report human size via summary.

Cluster **image size**: OCIR manifest sum when `OCIR_PASSWORD` available.

## Required user-facing summary

```
### Publish summary
- **Target:** …
- **Version:** … (build + version_name for app)
- **Image:** … (cluster)
- **Image size:** …
- **Duration:** wall + stage marks
- **Artifacts:** sizes from artifacts_bytes / detail
```

## Build speed (do not undo)

- No Buildkit prune before publish unless user asks (`-PruneBuildkit`).
- Publish `c35-rust-chef` when Rust toolchain/chef layer changes; cluster Dockerfiles `FROM` that image.
- Omit `-StopBuildkit` between publishes when possible.
